%N A136577 Conjectured Hankel transform of A136576(n+1).
%C A136577 a(n+1) is the Hankel transform of A086616. [From _Paul Barry_, Jun 03 2009]
%C A136577 a(n) = a(-n) for all n in Z. - _Michael Somos_, Aug 29 2026
%H A136577 Feihu Liu, Ying Wang, and Zihao Zhang, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.08703">Hankel Transform and (alpha,beta) Somos-4 Sequences</a>, arXiv:2608.08703 [math.CO], 2026. See pp. 2, 5, 49, 51, 53.
%F A136577 a(n) = 4^floor(n^2/4)*((1/2-sqrt(2)/2)*cos(3*Pi*n/4)+(1/2+sqrt(2)/2)*cos(Pi*n/4)).
%t A136577 a[ n_] := 4^Floor[n^2/4] * (-1)^Floor[(n+2)/4] * Sign[Mod[n+2, 4]]; (* _Michael Somos_, Aug 29 2026 *)
%o A136577 (PARI) {a(n) = 4^(n^2\4) * (-1)^((n+2)\4) * ((n+2)%4>0)}; /* _Michael Somos_, Aug 29 2026 */
